.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH swarm-import 1  "swarm 0.2.2" "Swarmgit manual"
.SH NAME
swarm\-import \- Read a bundle file, making its repo available offline
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBswarm import\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIFILE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Read a bundle file, making its repo available offline
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print one JSON object on stdout
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIFILE\fR>
Bundle file to read
